  "title": "How Does the Internet Work?",
  "brief": {
    "audience": "curious kids and adults who use the internet daily but have never wondered what actually happens when they hit send",
    "learningGoal": "After watching, the viewer can explain that the internet works by splitting data into addressed packets that hop router to router until they are reassembled at the destination.",
    "hook": "Your cat video just crossed an ocean through a cable on the seafloor in under a second — how did it get there?"
  },
